id: mutant-core-third-effect
name: Mutant Core: Integrate
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: mutant-core
fromEffect: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mutant Core's third effect, as a Maneuver: an Item Integrated, a tenth of your Maximum Ki back - and the Exploit to every Opponent in a Sphere around you.
text: >
  (3)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action, Integrate any Item you possess or currently have Equipped. Regain Ki Points equal to 1/10th of your Maximum Ki Points upon Integrating any Item through this effect. This effect triggers the Exploit Maneuver from all Opponents within a Sphere AoE (centered on you).

---

# Which Item, asked (chat.mjs mutantIntegrate); the Exploit offered on its card (use-maneuver.mjs, chat.mjs mutantCoreExploits).
[on used]
mutantIntegrate();
